Package: lifetimevalue
Type: Package
Title: Insurance Lifetime Value and Asset Share Pricing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Greg", "Sollenberger", email = "greg.sollenberger@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic multi-period calculations for insurance lifetime value,
    profitability, retention-sensitive pricing, and asset share style analysis.
    Projects premium, losses, expenses, policy survival, and discounted profit;
    solves analytically for a starting premium that meets a lifetime profit target;
    and quantifies the premium difference supported by alternative retention
    patterns while holding expected lifetime profit constant. The methods are
    consistent with the multi-period pricing framework discussed by Feldblum (1993)
    in "Asset Share Pricing for Property-Casualty Insurers"
    <https://www.casact.org/abstract/asset-share-pricing-property-casualty-insurers>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/gs-actuary/lifetimevalue
